              "setGlobal": { "found_architect_comms": true, "privesc_guide_offered": true },
              "sendTimedMessage": { "delay": 1500, "message": "You're in as them now. That sent mail in the home directory is addressed to architect@entropy.onion. Nobody leaks by accident to that address. A user shell won't show you the logs, though. You need root, and that sudo rule is the way. Privilege escalation guide's yours if you want it." }
