              "eventPattern": "npc_ko:agent_cipher",
              "onceOnly": true,
              "sendTimedMessage": { "delay": 2000, "message": "You hit Cipher? He's a mess and a genius and he is not your mole. The odd hours are a classified encryption project. The logs would have cleared him without you laying a finger on him." }
            },
            {
              "_comment": "KO -- Phantom (innocent). The interview is optional.",
              "eventPattern": "npc_ko:agent_phantom",
              "onceOnly": true,
              "sendTimedMessage": { "delay": 2000, "message": "Phantom's down. For the record, all that snooping was Phantom running the same hunt you are. Off the books, but on our side. You've just knocked out the only other person in this building trying to catch the mole." }
            },
            {
